~ start
solider_one: Would you and your team like to run a practice bout before the real fight?
- Let's do it => practice_fight_accept
- Not right now => practice_fight_decline

~ practice_fight_accept
solider_one: If you would like to end the practice bout, do so via the Pause Menu.
do QuestManager.practice_battle_started = true
do speaker.start_practice_fight()
=> END

~ practice_fight_decline
solider_one: Fair enough. Come find me if you want to spar.
=> END
